with the eternals headed to the silver  screen the sorceress known as cersei is  about to become a big deal to marvel  fans but who is this ancient superhero  and what's her story from the odyssey to  the avengers this is the history of  marvel's cersei explained the first run  of eternals begins with icarus on an  expedition with a scientist named daniel  damian and his daughter margot icarus  explains the threat posed by the race  known as the deviants who like the  eternals were created by the celestials  but where the eternals are good powerful  and kind the deviants are cruel hideous  and prone to mutation knowing a war is  coming icarus takes margo to cersei so  that she might keep the mortal girl safe  in her chic manhattan apartment  cersei agrees to do so and proceeds to  blow margot's mind by reminiscing about  the time she turned odysseus's crew into  pigs as well as the time she taught  merlin during her stint at king arthur's  court margot is of course floored by all  this especially since cersei appears to  be little more than a gal about town  who's prone to practicing her dance  moves during idol hours at home when the  deviants attack her apartment however  cersei further reveals her skills as a  warrior barraging her foes with cosmic  energy blocking their blasts of flame  and transforming them all into animals  old habits die hard apparently  cersei is legendary for her parties and  these shindigs aren't just fun either as  they often serve the plot of the stories  in which they appear for example during  one particularly raucous gathering  cersei is introduced to marvel heroes  such as the wasp she-hulk and star fox  who she learns as a fellow eternal the  party is interrupted when the eternals  attempt to summon her to participate in  the uni mind a kind of merging of their  souls but she ignores it undaunted the  eternals known as the delphin brothers  crash the party cersei is made to join  the uni mind which results in the  eternals deciding to leave earth cersei  refuses to go along with this however as  she enjoys living among humans way too  much to leave this encounter put cersei  on the avengers radar when captain  america needs help finding a bunch of  kids in 1989's captain america number  355 he turns to cersei to transform him  into a teenager later in avengers number  314 she actually joins the avengers at  cap's invitation it just goes to show  you one great party can change  everything  avengers  after the eternal and avenger known as  gilgamesh is severely injured his  teammates turned to cersei to help heal  him his condition is beyond her  abilities to fix but she does later  agree to join the avengers in his  absence facing the space pirate nebula  in her first mission cersei saves the  team from total obliteration and helps  restore reality in the process for a  while things go swimmingly for cersei  she handles mother night's brainwashing  tricks banishes radioactive foes  alongside thor and helps a demon called  the unspeakable one merge with his  literal better half all along cersei  remains her bubbly whip smart self and  she proves to be a major team asset  despite how different she is from the  rest of the avengers in short cersei  loves the heroics she loves the people  and she's awfully good at saving the day  but all that changes in her next mission  as an avenger  in a storyline beginning with 1991's  avengers number 334 the team faces an  alien race called the brethren led by  the charismatic thane ector soon after  capturing cersei thane ekdor falls in  love with her and she too realizes they  have a mysterious connection it is later  revealed that the brethren are also  creations of the celestials and the  collector and old avengers foe is  manipulating them to destroy earth  cersei forms the uni mind with the  brethren to defeat the collector despite  the fact that forming the unimined with  another species is forbidden to eternals  cersei's behavior changes in the  aftermath of this event she becomes more  violent and unstable even as she starts  to fall for her fellow avenger dane  whitman things are thrown into outright  chaos when the avengers get involved in  a huge interstellar war between the cree  and shiar which turns out to be a ruse  concocted by the cree's supreme  intelligence when the avengers learn of  this plot a breakaway group including  cersei kills him and this tears the  avengers apart complicating things  further dane develops feelings for new  teammate crystal and against his better  judgment starts a romance with cersei  too this does little to calm cersei who  soon grows even more troubled when the  team travels to a distant dimension and  fails to stop a young girl from being  sacrificed by a priest cersei ends up  killing the priest in revenge  after killing the priest cersei flees to  wakanda dane talks her into coming back  but upon her return she inexplicably  attacks the avengers she's eventually  defeated by an imposter of the vision  who has been sent to infiltrate the team  it turns out that anti-vision is one of  the gatherers whose leader the  mysterious proctor is hell-bent on  terrorizing cersei cersei's fellow  eternals icarus arex and sprite arrive  and demand the avengers hand cersei over  to them icarus says she is suffering  from a form of insanity found in  eternals called the mad weary and that  it was probably caused by her use of the  unimined now her fellow eternals plan to  take her home to olympia and have her  cleansed which means disintegrating her  at a molecular level the eternal  equivalent of execution the avengers  don't like the sound of this and a short  fight ensues only ending when sprite  reads cersei's mind and realizes she's  in love with dane without asking his  permission it corresponds dane to cersei  as her gan joseon or soulmate dane who  had just made a move on crystal is  forced into following a terrifying  imperative be with cersei or let her die  cersei's life continues to spiral out of  control especially after she's connected  to the deaths of two detectives and when  the police arrive to arrest her for the  killings she responds by leveling  avengers mansion and destroying the  brooklyn bridge dane remains by her side  forced by their bond into standing with  her until cersei goes after crystal that  is only then does dane realize that she  needs to be stopped at this point the  enigmatic proctor captures her and  reveals himself as the dane whitman of  an alternate universe he was rejected by  the cersei of his world so he made it  his mission to drive her insane in every  other reality using powers stolen from a  watcher at last cersei knows her erratic  behavior is not her fault but the damage  has been done regardless cersei kills  him with his own ebony blade and exiles  herself to another dimension the dane of  her world his own mind cleared by  proctor's death opts to join her  cersei and dane enter the ultraverse of  malibu comics home to an alternate earth  and a whole other cast of superheroes  the journey has the desired effect as  cersei is able to exist dimensions away  from proctor's control and so finally  comes to her senses that clarity doesn't  last long unfortunately as she's  immediately possessed by a heretofore  unknown infinity gem called the ego gem  subsequently the other infinity gems are  transported to the ultraverse along with  the trickster god loki surprise  loki obtains the other six gems and the  possessed cersei sends a superhero team  called ultraforce led by dane after him  when the grandmaster travels to the  ultraverse to seek his old mind gem he  proposes a contest to loki his pawns  will be the avengers zapped to the  ultraverse while loki's team will be  ultraforce loki wins but it turns out  that this was all a ruse for cersei to  get close enough for the ego gem to  reunite with the other legendary stones  the gem becomes a sentient god-like  being named nemesis nemesis combines the  two universes but can't quite hold them  together and is ultimately defeated when  dane cuts off her crown with the ebony  blade that splits the gems apart once  again reconstitutes the ultraverse and  gives dean and cersei the chance to  return home  when they return to earth cersei and  dane don't arrive in the present day  instead they find themselves in the  midst of the crusades dane's mind winds  up in the body of a crusader ancestor  named eobar gerrington and it takes  cersei convincing ayobar's spirit to  move on before dane can assert himself  ayobar's best friend and fellow crusader  bene du perry isn't pleased about all  this as the pair had been on their way  to find the eternal pharaoh in his tower  of power dane's accidental takeover of  aobar's body spells the end of that  quest angering binet who goes on by  himself binet is then found by the  pharaoh who turns out to be the mutant  supervillain apocalypse  i  have returned  he activates benay's latent mutant  powers and binay becomes the powerful  telepath exodus apocalypse orders him to  kill dane and cersei but he refuses to  kill his old friend  so as punishment apocalypse strips him  of his powers and traps him in suspended  animation for the next 900 years exodus  would later be freed by magneto in an  x-factor storyline from the early 90s in  the end cersei and dane managed to  return to their rightful time albeit  once again in different places the trip  tears apart their gan joseon link too  and cersei and dane decide to split up  for good  left with nowhere else to go cersei  returns to olympia at the time  apocalypse is busy turning deviants into  mindless monsters who've begun attacking  humans and so the eternals pose as a new  team of superheroes called the new breed  joining them cersei takes the code name  mesmer this lasts until the mischievous  eternal known as sprite pulls his  ultimate prank in the lead up to the  2006 eternals series erasing the  memories of every eternal as a result  cersei becomes a mild-mannered party  planner ignorant of her powers and  origin when one of her parties is  attacked by terrorists makari her former  lover and fellow eternal helps stop them  iron man then shows up to question  makari who is living an amnesiac life as  mark curry stark recognizes cersei as a  former avenger but is shocked to  discover that there is no record of her  in any of the team's files as it turns  out this is all a deviant ruse designed  to awaken the dreaming celestial who has  been banished to earth for speaking out  against the abuse of deviants when  makari convinces the dreaming celestial  to wait 50 years before passing judgment  on earth cersei decides to give up super  heroics once and for all she goes back  to her party planning job and other than  occasionally advising the avengers keeps  her promise to stay retired in 2018's  avengers number one the bodies of dead  celestials begin raining down on earth  who could have killed these omnipotent  beings so easily as it turns out it was  the final host of dark celestials ready  to wipe out the earth for good the  avengers learn that these celestials  serve a transcendent being called the  fulcrum and their job is to not only  experiment on young worlds but to  destroy them after millions of years in  order to reap their energy the fulcrum  also created a race of insect creatures  called the horde and the dark celestials  came about when the horde infected a  number of celestials the eternals  learned that their true purpose wasn't  to protect humanity after all but to  cultivate them like crops for the good  of these celestials this realization  drives them all mad leading to each of  their deaths thanks to icarus's last  words iron man is able to determine a  way for humans to form the uni mind he  is then told that something in human dna  can stop the horde and the avengers  managed to save the day sometime later  cersei and her fellow eternals are  resurrected by the machines that give  their kind their immortality after a  short conflict with thanos however  icarus discovers another horrifying  truth behind their existence essentially  that a human being is killed every time  an eternal is resurrected icarus decides  this process is pretty much unacceptable  and he cersei and their fellow eternals  set out to solve the problem once and  for all check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite marvel comics  are coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  you

